Create a CSS style sheet to set font size of all headings to 20px, font weight to bold, color to blue, and add a 1px solid border around each heading.

### Response:
```css
h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: blue;
  border: 1px solid;
}
```

